 "note": "S, 17 platforms, mirrored both ways. THREE rotors on the middle line: the centre (C) and the stone next to each home (M): ACROSS opens the straight middle road, UP / DOWN shuts it and opens the north / south ways (at M: home - M - the top / bottom corner). A 1-bridge ferry joins the top pair and another the bottom pair. The outer roads to the top-left and bottom-right ferry piers are belts running toward the centre (the pinwheel's turn). Finale: the star round the centre rotor.",
 "geometricSymmetry": true,
 "experimental": false,
 "ruleWaivers": {
  "N03": "66 m TRY (Daniele 2026-11-06, Desk R04): no ferry over N fits 66 m while N keeps a fixed deck (G13 / G04, see pinwheel()), so N and S hang on the centre rotor alone - reachable only while it stands UP / DOWN, an island while it stands ACROSS. Shown to Daniele next to the 78 m original; his call",
  "N04": "66 m TRY (Daniele 2026-11-06, Desk R04): no ferry over N fits 66 m while N keeps a fixed deck (G13 / G04, see pinwheel()), so N and S hang on the centre rotor alone - reachable only while it stands UP / DOWN, an island while it stands ACROSS. Shown to Daniele next to the 78 m original; his call"
 },
